OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry start to the
OL,6,Fmorning, with brighter skies
OL,7,Fdeveloping. A scattering of showers
OL,8,Fthen moving in for the afternoon, some
OL,9,Fof which maybe heavy. Breezy for some,
OL,10,Fespecially along northern coasts and
OL,11,Ffeeling cooler.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers continue overnight,
OL,14,Fmostly in the west and north.
OL,15,FElsewhere stays mostly dry with clear
OL,16,Fspells. Winds easing and feeling cool
OL,17,Ffor many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
