OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAny showers will ease
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, leaving a mostly
OL,7,Fdry and bright day with sunny spells.
OL,8,FLight winds making it feel slightly
OL,9,Fwarmer than Tuesday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FStaying changeable through the week,
OL,13,Fas another band of rain moves in from
OL,14,Fthe west on Thursday, before drier and
OL,15,Fbrighter weather returns on Friday.
OL,16,FTemperatures likely around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
